(7610648, 1231267, 16216, '<td valign="top">This is a nice Snapshot for the family album, The softness and noise in IMO do not do this justice and takes away from the subjects, Also it is framed off balanced. As this would work with some subjects , it  accentuates the softness on the Right side.  Sorry not a favorite at all. Good luck with future submissions.</td>', 'This is a nice Snapshot for the family album, The softness and noise in IMO do not do this justice and takes away from the subjects, Also it is framed off balanced. As this would work with some subjects , it  accentuates the softness on the Right side.  Sorry not a favorite at all. Good luck with future submissions.', '2019-01-27 08:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
