(7610653, 1231091, 16216, '<td valign="top">Ah the elusive Whitetail... Might wand to speed up your shutter speed to stop them in action, Nice Try</td>', 'Ah the elusive Whitetail... Might wand to speed up your shutter speed to stop them in action, Nice Try', '2019-01-27 08:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7610654, 1231443, 16216, '<td valign="top">Knowing how to read your camera''s histogram is the most important thing you can do to ensure a good exposure. If Your camera gives you the option to show the range of brightness in your image as a graph, which plots the light levels from jet black, on the left, to pure white, on the right. you should try to use it. In this shot you lose so many details in the shadows. Shooting in raw helps since you can adjust in post.  If you are shooting digital Jump on Youtube and take a quick video tutorial on using a histogram.  Good Luck</td>', 'Knowing how to read your camera''s histogram is the most important thing you can do to ensure a good exposure. If Your camera gives you the option to show the range of brightness in your image as a graph, which plots the light levels from jet black, on the left, to pure white, on the right. you should try to use it. In this shot you lose so many details in the shadows. Shooting in raw helps since you can adjust in post.  If you are shooting digital Jump on Youtube and take a quick video tutorial on using a histogram.  Good Luck', '2019-01-27 09:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7610655, 1231490, 16216, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Tones... Nice composition, excellent use of a wide DOF.. This shot deserves equal exposure to the rocks and the starfish. Excellent work</td>', 'Beautiful Tones... Nice composition, excellent use of a wide DOF.. This shot deserves equal exposure to the rocks and the starfish. Excellent work', '2019-01-27 09:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7610656, 1231181, 16216, '<td valign="top">Guess I am on a Dynamic range kick today, There is such a sudden drop from Light to shadow, I see the light harsh, but is also looks like this could be close the the golden Hour with shadow direction. When I say dynamic range, you are losing all detail in the shadows, now You actually might have wanted that, however if you tweaked your blacks just barely and let edge details of the shadow show... Nevermind I am ranting, This is a really nice abstract shot. Good Luck</td>', 'Guess I am on a Dynamic range kick today, There is such a sudden drop from Light to shadow, I see the light harsh, but is also looks like this could be close the the golden Hour with shadow direction. When I say dynamic range, you are losing all detail in the shadows, now You actually might have wanted that, however if you tweaked your blacks just barely and let edge details of the shadow show... Nevermind I am ranting, This is a really nice abstract shot. Good Luck', '2019-01-27 09:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7610657, 1231205, 16216, '<td valign="top">Step 1/2 step to the left to get the beads out of the equation and turn just slightly back to the right to center this. Trying to cut off equal parts of the two outer statues (sorry not sure what they are called)  This picture is off balanced and the bead up top right distracting. Use the viewfinder to compose out distractions, however nice focus and color...</td>', 'Step 1/2 step to the left to get the beads out of the equation and turn just slightly back to the right to center this. Trying to cut off equal parts of the two outer statues (sorry not sure what they are called)  This picture is off balanced and the bead up top right distracting. Use the viewfinder to compose out distractions, however nice focus and color...', '2019-01-27 09:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
