(7611112, 1231269, 138630, '<td valign="top">This one fascinates me.  The colors are beautiful but unexpected and I''m not sure how you got this wavery effect - I''m looking at the reflections of grasses in the water?  Interesting and effective perspective.</td>', 'This one fascinates me.  The colors are beautiful but unexpected and I''m not sure how you got this wavery effect - I''m looking at the reflections of grasses in the water?  Interesting and effective perspective.', '2019-01-29 22:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7611114, 1231471, 50641, '<td valign="top">Thank you for this degree of ambiguity. The blur is such a wonderful respite for the eyes.  The stanchions provide visual support and also help to iconize her. The title works on many levels. Her pose is triumphant and yet she seems barred from progressing.  She has the knock-kneed stance of a young girl but the willowy silhouette of a young woman. Her characteristics are masked but her complications are clear. She is asking Y.</td>', 'Thank you for this degree of ambiguity. The blur is such a wonderful respite for the eyes.  The stanchions provide visual support and also help to iconize her. The title works on many levels. Her pose is triumphant and yet she seems barred from progressing.  She has the knock-kneed stance of a young girl but the willowy silhouette of a young woman. Her characteristics are masked but her complications are clear. She is asking Y.', '2019-01-29 22:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
