(7611265, 1231267, 50695, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by vmagic118:</b></div><hr/><i> This is a nice Snapshot for the family album, The softness and noise in IMO do not do this justice and takes away from the subjects, Also it is framed off balanced. As this would work with some subjects , it  accentuates the softness on the Right side.  Sorry not a favorite at all. Good luck with future submissions. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I''m imagining this fellow running into you as you''re photographing. He says, "there''s a plastic bag on your camera."<br/> <br/>"A what??" you ask. "Oh dear! Thank you! Thank you so much! You''ve saved my photos!"</td>', 'Originally posted by vmagic118: This is a nice Snapshot for the family album, The softness and noise in IMO do not do this justice and takes away from the subjects, Also it is framed off balanced. As this would work with some subjects , it  accentuates the softness on the Right side.  Sorry not a favorite at all. Good luck with future submissions.   I''m imagining this fellow running into you as you''re photographing. He says, "there''s a plastic bag on your camera." "A what??" you ask. "Oh dear! Thank you! Thank you so much! You''ve saved my photos!"', '2019-01-30 14:52:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(7611268, 1231181, 50695, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by vmagic118:</b></div><hr/><i> Guess I am on a Dynamic range kick today, There is such a sudden drop from Light to shadow, I see the light harsh, but is also looks like this could be close the the golden Hour with shadow direction. When I say dynamic range, you are losing all detail in the shadows, now You actually might have wanted that, however if you tweaked your blacks just barely and let edge details of the shadow show... Nevermind I am ranting, This is a really nice abstract shot. Good Luck </i></td></tr></table> I guess he doesn''t like horses.</td>', 'Originally posted by vmagic118: Guess I am on a Dynamic range kick today, There is such a sudden drop from Light to shadow, I see the light harsh, but is also looks like this could be close the the golden Hour with shadow direction. When I say dynamic range, you are losing all detail in the shadows, now You actually might have wanted that, however if you tweaked your blacks just barely and let edge details of the shadow show... Nevermind I am ranting, This is a really nice abstract shot. Good Luck  I guess he doesn''t like horses.', '2019-01-30 15:04:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(7611269, 1230939, 113156, '<td valign="top">Ah wow that shadow, its like a Tyrannosaurus rex. This should have finished up at the top me thinks.</td>', 'Ah wow that shadow, its like a Tyrannosaurus rex. This should have finished up at the top me thinks.', '2019-01-30 15:11:49.000000', NULL, 0),
